  {
    "description": "Covers NWS forecast and county zone discovery, metadata, forecasts, and observations, returning zone records or associated data.\nlist: Browse zones with optional type and other filters; use when type is unknown or optional.\nlist_by_type: Browse zones with type as a required filter; use when zone type is the primary search criterion.\nmeta: Fetch metadata for one zone by type and ID; use for zone details without forecast content.\nforecast: Fetch the active forecast text for a specific zone; use for current forecast periods.\nobservations: Retrieve observation records within a zone over a time range; use for historical or current readings.\nstations: List observation stations located within a zone; use to discover station IDs for a zone.\ntransmitter: Retrieve the transmitter associated with a county zone; use only for county-type zones.\n\nAction parameters (\"?\" = optional):\n- list(id?: array, area?: array, region?: array, type?: array, point?: string, include_geometry?: boolean, limit?: integer, effective?: string)\n- list_by_type(type: array, id?: array, area?: array, region?: array, point?: string, include_geometry?: boolean, limit?: integer, effective?: string)\n- meta(type: string [land|marine|forecast|public|coastal|offshore|fire|county], zoneId: string, effective?: string)\n- forecast(type: string, zoneId: string)\n- observations(zoneId: string, start?: string, end?: string, limit?: integer)\n- stations(zoneId: string, limit?: integer, cursor?: string)\n- transmitter(type: string [county], zoneId: string)",
    "inputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "action": {
          "description": "Which operation to perform; see the tool description for each action.",
          "enum": [
